    {
      "id": 7700,
      "name": "Dyce",
      "username": "Dyce",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dyce/{size}/2822_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-15T11:37:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everybody.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>I don't know if i have to make a introduction or presentation of myself before going in this forum, but i'm used to do it, so…i do it  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=9\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\"></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>What can i say…my nickname is Dyce, i'm French (so excuse me for my english  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/blush.png?v=9\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\"> ) and i'n new to the Multiverse.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>I discovered the game by another forum, where one of the members says \"it's one of the best superhero game he ever plays\"…So, i decided to buy the Ehanced edition to try it, and i fall in love with the game…</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Hobbies : Cinema, tv Show and reading…lots of reading (comics, books and manga).</p>\n<p>I'm a RPG player (Player and Dungeon master)…</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>What else can I say…Happy to be now a part of the multiverse !!</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:02.556Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 2,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 10.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 7699,
      "topic_slug": "introducing-dyce",
      "display_username": "Dyce",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Hi everybody.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI don&#39;t know if i have to make a introduction or presentation of myself before going in this forum, but i&#39;m used to do it, so.....i do it  :grin: \n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\nWhat can i say.....my nickname is Dyce, i&#39;m French (so excuse me for my english  :blush: ) and i&#39;n new to the Multiverse.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI discovered the game by another forum, where one of the members says &quot;it&#39;s one of the best superhero game he ever plays&quot;.....So, i decided to buy the Ehanced edition to try it, and i fall in love with the game....\n\n&nbsp;\n\nHobbies : Cinema, tv Show and reading....lots of reading (comics, books and manga).\n\nI&#39;m a RPG player (Player and Dungeon master)....\n\n&nbsp;\n\nWhat else can I say.....Happy to be now a part of the multiverse !!",
